# Time-bound allowlist for the BLOCKING finished-image Trivy scans (see .github/workflows/ci.yml):
# both the collector image (build-image job) and the bundled Caddy image (caddy-image job) mount
# this same file, so an entry here applies to BOTH scans.
#
# The scans fail CI on any fixable HIGH/CRITICAL in either image. To accept a specific known
# finding, add its ID here — ALWAYS with an expiry, so a suppression can't linger silently:
#
#   CVE-2025-12345 exp:2026-12-31
#
# Empty = no exceptions. Prefer bumping the base-image pin over adding an entry.
